# Biomass Mutation X = 1 (CR 613.4b-c, 611.2c). Ornithopter (0/2) wears Rancor (+2/+0): the set to 1/1 is the base, the
# Aura's bonus still applies on top, so it is a 3/1 whichever was first. A Snapcaster Mage cast after the spell has
# resolved is not "a creature you control" at that time and stays 2/1 - the effect fixes its set of creatures as it
# resolves. At the next turn the base is back: the Ornithopter is a 2/2 (0/2 and Rancor).

